 "notes": "The Training Area, the one practice space (title screen, the Expedition menu, the farm's Esc menu). Ability Ring: the old Arena floor (round, low ruin walls with four gates, four 2x2 blocks to slam into, a dais, two grass patches); your start, the three practice dummies and the sparring bot. Range (east gate): still dummies at 10, 20 and 35 m from the line at x 43. Movement Lane (over the bridge from the range): a low wall to vault, a 2 m gap, ledges at 0.8, 1.6 and 2.4 m (step, jump, mantle), a 3 m gap to dash, a ramp up to 4.8 m and a drop off its end, with the Landing islet 6 m out for air control. Practice Wing (south bridge): the checklist's gear rack, crates, the target monsters and the Duel Room pad. No monsters, chests or breakables are spawned on the map itself.",
